# Public, non-secret config for production builds, committed on purpose.
# Read by `vite build` (web) and by apps/mobile/loadRootEnv.cjs for release
# bundles; dev servers and `bun test` never load it. Secrets and the Convex
# deployment stay in .env.production.local / the hosting environment.

# Sentry DSNs (crash reporting). A DSN only lets a client send events to its
# project. Without one (dev, CI, forks with this file removed) nothing is sent.
